	"THE LAMPLIGHTERS": "LOS FAROLEROS",
	"Who kept the streets lit": "Quienes mantuvieron las calles encendidas",
	"Through nine years of rain": "Durante nueve años de lluvia",
	"The hive that went quiet": "La colmena que calló",
	"THANK YOU FOR PLAYING": "GRACIAS POR JUGAR",
	"The rain is still loud": "La lluvia sigue sonando fuerte",
	"No one is calling you home": "Nadie te llama a casa",
	"I thought I was running from the rift. I was only running back toward it.": "Creí que huía de la grieta. Solo corría de vuelta hacia ella.",
	"The gate is closed, Kestrel. Whatever you decide to be next, I will be in your ear.": "La puerta está cerrada, Kestrel. Lo que decidas ser después, estaré en tu oído.",
	"Then keep talking, ORACLE. The city has a lot of rain left to name.": "Entonces sigue hablando, ORÁCULO. A la ciudad le queda mucha lluvia por nombrar.",
